{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25758","headline":"镜听词 · 李廓","name":"镜听词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匣中取镜辞竈王，罗衣掩尽明月光。\n昔时长着照容色，今夜潜将听消息。\n门前地黑人来稀，无人错道朝夕归。\n更深弱体冷如铁，绣带菱花怀里热。\n铜片铜片如有灵，愿照得见行人千里形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李廓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}